  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How can I submit the Employment Allowance to my client?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 29 Apr, 2021 at 11:30 AM\n\n### Navigation: Payroll> Submissions> FPS & EPS > Employment Payment Summary\n\nClick here to watch how to claim Employment Allowance\n\nYou may submit an EPS for the Employment Allowance.\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nFirstly, click Add Submission on the right side\n\nA new record will be created.\n\nPlease click yes or no from the claim employment allowance box.\n\nWhen yes is clicked, 5 boxes for DemiStateAid appear. If none of these aid allowance apply please click Not Applicable\n\nIf DemiStateAid is chosen HMRC will decide the account to claim.\n\nPlease then follow the page and fill out the boxes where claims are needed. \n\nClick whether to include bank details and whether this is a final submission\n\nFinally, click HMRC submit.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How can I submit the Employment Allowance to my client?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 29 Apr, 2021 at 11:30 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h4 dir=\"ltr\" style='box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; line-height: 21.875px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Navigation: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Payroll&gt; Submissions&gt; FPS &amp; EPS &gt; Employment Payment Summary</span></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/d41f1faa563b4114992766b0eb5e1779\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click here to watch how to claim Employment Allowance</strong></a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">You may submit an EPS for the Employment Allowance.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Help/Guide:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Firstly, click Add Submission on the right side</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9128375859/original/c_gWXnHD69fmKtUvdGpu_cO1D2p5CQqd1w.png?1619692044\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9128375859\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">A new record will be created.</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Please click <strong>yes</strong> or <strong>no</strong> from the claim employment allowance box.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">When <strong>yes</strong> is clicked, 5 boxes for DemiStateAid appear. If none of these aid allowance apply please click Not Applicable<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">If DemiStateAid is chosen HMRC will decide the account to claim.<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9128375353/original/5nWUi6vzHO64TXzNGe8Rp0Y2Szm1NBHaDw.png?1619691628\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9128375353\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Please then follow the page and fill out the boxes where claims are needed. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Click whether to include bank details and whether this is a final submission</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9128376041/original/0PefchYs_LhlBvwqk26CrMwpkfZjocxtCQ.png?1619692151\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9128376041\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Finally, click HMRC submit.</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165665\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165665/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165665\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165665/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedbac